<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh Tit</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh Tit</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tiikiŋ Tit nikɗi ŋ teerndiŋ Tum ci, waaye Pool woyiɗ tiik ce ŋ in laayiɗ ŋ fiis ci a kaɓɗoh. Ini Pool fiis ŋ Tit ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:1-3">Ɓi Galaat 2:1-3</ref></char>, wa miniɗ teel ngaŋ pangkiŋ Pool, wa miniɗ nik ne wa nikee bala ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka koc, ŋ kaɗaŋ ɗe ŋ Yudee ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 11:27-30">Tum ci 11:27-30</ref></char>, wala ŋ finho ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka koc ŋ kaɗaŋ ɗe ndaam ngaŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15">Tum ci 15</ref></char>. Ŋ finho ineem, Pool woyiɗ tiikiŋ Tit ŋ Fiisi a kanakɗoh kaɓɗoh ɓi Korenta, wa a fiis ŋ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka kaahayɗoh. Wa ñiiniɗ ndeem ne Tit nikee ɓaatɗoh keeh-keeh ngaŋ Pool.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:13">2 Korenta 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:6-16">7:6-16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ finho taƴuukaŋ Pool koc ŋ Rom,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:16-31">Tum ci 28:16-31</ref></char></note> Pool faɗsuusa. Ŋ jamanoonaam, weɗ a kaɗoh na Tit Keret. Wa Pool pul Keret, a faɗ Tit ndaam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:5">Tit 1:5</ref></char></note> Waam weɗ a fiisoh kaɓɗohii. Ŋ reehɗohaaniŋ kaɓɗohi, a woosa ne a hey woose ƴaar wiiriis ŋ Keret, a woosa Tit ne a hayaat ɗe marke ne yi na hee ɗe namsiɗe ree ɗah. Ini mirndoh kerhu ŋ Tit weɗ Pool fiis ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:10">2 Timoote 4:10</ref></char>. Ŋ ndeem, Pool taƴissuusa ŋ kaso, te a inahha ne a hey apse. Ini a woo rohƴiɗ, waaye wa teeɓoh ne ɓa risee kerhoh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Janguuniŋ Keret nikee haneeɗa camb, te nakoh ci na jangɗoh ciŋ Pool raakiɗ etoh ŋ mboolo mand ɗaa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh Tit kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Pool kañɗiɗ Tit, a woosa ƴissuut ŋ pangkiŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-5">1:1-5</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Mandohaaɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi adgohan Janguuni <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">1:6-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Miskiɗ ci raak ŋ Keret <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:11-16">1:11-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi ɓo' joy tumoh na ɓooɓi jen<char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Njirñiŋ yegɗohiŋ baahohi <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 2:11-15">2:11-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Nakoh ci wuu findi kosiɗ ci joy nikoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:1-11">3:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kooɗkiŋ ɓaaɓ ci, na kañɗoh ci mirndoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3:12-15</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗa Tit, mi yi Pool, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Kooh na <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, ñam kooɗu ne ŋ woo ɓi Kooh tan, ɓa hay ŋ kosi, ŋ inhiɗ ɓa baahiɗ keeh ki, keeh ki hun na nup Kooh. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Ŋ ineem, ɓa hey oolke ne ɓa hey raake kipes ki heyɗi reehe. Kooh yi na leyeeɗi, a yi gapoh kipes keem bala Adina fersan. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Kooh Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo, wi jamanooni a gapohee ineem hay, a inhiɗohiɗ woo kiŋ ɗe weem, a dengkohha so wa ne ŋ yegɗoha.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Mi yii fiis kaytii ne ŋ woo na ɗa Tit, fu yi ŋ amb findi kuɓuuso keeh-keeh ŋ kosi ɓoo ɓaah. Kooh Baabi na Yeesu Kiristaa Mucɗohi baahohaat ɗa, on ɗa jam !<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi adgoh Janguuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Ŋ faɗiɗ ɗa ŋ Keret ne fu ɗiindoh in ci tasee tufkiɗu ŋ ndeem, ne fu kooɗ ŋ kur-taah nu nik yakak ci adgohan Janguuna nik nga. Tuma findi ŋ woyoh ɗa wa. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Yaa nu nga ɓa joy nik ɓo' raakaaɗi woyɗaah moɗaaɗi, a top ŋ ɓitiice, komaakciŋ ɗe joyiɗ kos, ɓa joyɗi inhu ŋ tumohaaɗ mbalay wala kerhiɗaaɗi ɓo'.<verse eid="TIT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Yi adgohan ɓi Janguuni, a taambkohan pangkiŋ Kooh, weɗ tah a joyɗi raak woyɗaah moɗaaɗi. A joyɗi yaksiɗuk, a joyɗi yooɓ ayruk, a joyɗi nik laaroh, a joyɗi nik ɓo' waaɗiɗ hiñoh, a joyɗi waak kopor ŋ ini lahɗi waas, <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />waaye a joy joy daliɗ baahiɗ ɓi na haye kahan ce, a waaɗ in baahiɗ, a hendoh pesohaaɗiŋ ɗe, a yurah, a hool wuu Kooh, a min amb haf ce.<verse eid="TIT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />A joy joy amb ndengiɗ woo ki wooriɗi, wi hun na ini jangɗohu. Ŋ ndeem a hey mine ñaah ɓinooɓi na jangɗohi wiriɗi te a teeɓ ɓi na ɗalee wa ne wa ɗaa haa.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi na tufkiɗe jangɗoh ci nikɗi keeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Raakiɗ ɓo' laayiɗ nga ɗu ɓi kerhiɗɗi ali ɓo'. Ɓa na ñaañohe ɓooɓi na woo ciŋ ɓa mbalay ci ; ɓoo ɓeem uupoh ŋ Yawuut ci nik na ɗu. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ranga nguɓ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa na yahrohe kos kahan limb, ɓa jangɗohee in ci ɓa joyɗi jangɗoh, sagu waaɗ raak kopor ŋ ini lahɗi waas. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Ɓo' Keret, ɓaah na ɓa, a woosuuɗ sah, ɓaah nga ɓa, a woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 1:12">« Ɓi Keret moos nik leyoh ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 1:12">ɓa ɗoopaat saahiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 1:12">ɓa waaɗ ñam te ɓa tiriɓpa ! »<verse eid="TIT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Ini woyu nga ɓa weem, wa keeh, tahha po woytoha ɓa woytoh ndengiɗ ne ɓa min raak kos moɗoɗ, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />weɗ ngisoh ɓa sikɗukee andiin ciŋ Yawuut ci na nakoh ci puloh ŋ ɓi suungɗuk keeh ki.<verse eid="TIT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Ɓooɓi hooliɗ ci, in ci jen hooliɗ nga ɓa waaye ɓi hoolaaɗiici te ɓa sannga kos, ali in hoolɗi nga ɓa. Laam nga ɓa, liiɓ ciŋ ɓa hoolɗi, ca minɗi inhisoh baahiɗ na baahaaɗi. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Ɓa na woye ne ɓa inhiɗ Kooh, waaye tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa taasiɗ ɓa, ɓa siɓaah, ɓa kerhiɗɗi ali ɓo' te ɓa minɗi haɓiɗ ali in baahiɗ.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Nakoh ci kaɗ ŋ yaɓkooci na ɓitif ci na komaakci na ñaam ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Ini kaɗ nga ɗa nak, Tit, woya ini hun na jangɗohi wiriɗi. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Woya yaɓkooci ɓa min amb haf ciŋ ɓa, ɓa nik eɗaah cir, ɓa hendoh pesohaaɗiŋ ɓa, kosiŋ ɓa wir, wa hun na waaɗi ɓa waaɗ ɓooɓi na muñi ɓa muñ ɓa seke.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Wa mand ɗaa ŋ ɓitif ci, ɓa raakaat mandohaaɗi neɓ Kooh ; ɓa ɗooɓohuu, ɓa ŋoɗuu ŋ sangara, ɓa dengohee in baahiɗ, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />ne ɓa min jangiɗ jeeg ci, ɓeem waaɗ ƴaar ciŋ ɓa na kuɓuuciŋ ɓa, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />ɓa hendoh pesohaaɗiŋ ɓa, ɓa hool te ɓa taambkoh kahan ciŋ ɓa, ɓa nik ɓo' baahiɗ te ɓa kerhiɗ ƴaar ciŋ ɓa, ŋ ineem, ɓo' riiɓɗuu woo kiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Nama ñaah komaakci ƴaar ci ɓa hendoh pesohaaɗiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Te fu, ŋ in nu wa min ki nik ɗah, nika altiɗkohaah ŋ tum in baahiɗ na jangɗoh yurhiɗ. Jangɗohiŋ ɗa joyiɗ nawu, <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />wa wir, ali ɓo' minuu wa nihis. Wa kaɗoh ɗaa ɗah, sangiɗ ciŋ ɓoo hey kaci'e, ɓa raakuu ali in moɗaaɗi woyaah nga ɓoo.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Woya <char style="w">ñaam</char> ci ɓa kerhiɗ ɓi raak ɓa ngaŋ in ci jen, ɓa tumee ini neɓ ɓeem, ɓa taasohuu na ɓa, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />ɓa rokɗuu ɓa ali in, waaye ɓa teeɓohee ne ɓa cariɗ oolku keeh-keeh. Ŋ in ceem jen, ɓa hey moɗɗe jangɗohi kaɗ ŋ Kooh, Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cuuɓi ɓaah ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Jangɗoheem raakiɗ njiriñ, laam Kooh teeɓohiɗ baahohi a baahoh ɓooɓi, baahohi rangis waasiŋ muci wuu ɓooɓi jen. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Baahohiŋ ɗe na ɓoo weem, wa na jangɗe ɓoo ne ɓoo penduk kaañ Kooh, na waaɗ-waaɗ ciŋ adinaani. Ŋ ineem ɓoo min pes ŋ adinaanii kipes hendohuuɗ, yurhiɗ, huniɗ na waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />te ɓoo sekee mbehi neɓiɗi ɓoo oolkoh : hayiŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> ŋ yaki a yak, a yi Kooh, Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="TIT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />A eɗohiɗ haf ce wuu ɓoo ne a tos ɓoo ŋ moɗaaɗi nu nik. Ŋ hoolɗi a hooliɗ ɓoo, a tumiɗ ɓoo cuuɓ hooliɗ, ɓoo nikka cuuɓi a raak, cuuɓi sawaran ŋ tum in baahiɗ. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Fu joy jangɗoh in ceem Tit, fu ñaahee ɓi na sikɗukee ɗa, fu kuƴsee ɓa, wa hun na kikilifa mitiɗ. Ali ɓo' kinaat ɗa heef !<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Nakoh ci wuu findi kosiɗ ci joy nikoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Gena naandis ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci ne ɓa joy joy teyɗuk kilifaaci na ɓi adgoh kur ki ; ɓa kerhiɗ ɓa te ɓa tokɗuk ne ɓa haɓiɗ in baahiɗ nu nik. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Ɓa ɓasuu ali ɓo', ɓa wortuk lahtoh, ɓa nik ɓo' baahiɗ, ɓa nik ɓo' soosiɗ ŋ ɓooɓi jen.<verse eid="TIT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Ɗeɓgaan ɓoo namee nik ɓo' naandiɗ, ɓooɓi kerhiɗɗi ali ɓo', ɓo' muuƴiɗ, a kiñin ciŋ ɓoo na waaɗ-waaɗ nu nik ceɗ adgiɗee ɓoo. Ɓoo peseeɗa ŋ añaand na siistiɗoh, ɓoo nikee sangaah te ɓoo sangtiɗohha ŋ harmban ɓoo.<verse eid="TIT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Waaye wi Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:4">Yi Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:4">teeɓoh baahkiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:4">na waaɗiŋ ɗe na ɓooɓi,<verse eid="TIT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />a mucɗiɗ ɓoo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="TIT 3:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">Te wa ŋ tumohaaɗ ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">ciŋ ɓoo yurhiɗ ci haa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">waaye ɓoo misik ɗe misik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">a muciɗta ɓoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">taamboh ŋ ɓooki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">ɓooki tah ɓoo rimkis,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">a onnda ɓoo kipes as</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:5">taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ;<verse eid="TIT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />a ruhsiɗta Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:6">laayoh na laayoh nga ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:6">taamboh ŋ Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:6">Mucɗohiŋ ɓoo.<verse eid="TIT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />Ŋ baahohi a baahoh ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:7">a ambiɗ ɓoo ɓo' yurhiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:7">a onnda ɓoo kipes ki reehanɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="TIT 3:7">wi ɓoo ooluk ne ɓoo heya rahse.<verse eid="TIT 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Woo keem wooriɗ, te ŋ waaɗiɗ ne fu ndengiɗa baahiɗ, ne ɓi kos Kooh liiɓ ciŋ ɓa puluu ŋ ndengɗuk ŋ tum in baahiɗ. Ineem weɗ moɗ te wa raakka njiriñ ŋ ɓooɓi. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Waaye wortuka taastiɗoh ci naandohaaci, limiŋ caac ci, na lahtoh ci na taastiɗoh ci ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>. In ceem jen ca raakɗi njiriñ te ca ɓarang ɓarang.<verse eid="TIT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Yaa nu ɓek saɓsukoh ŋ ɓooɓi ɗah, woytohaa ɗe waas yino po waas kanak, a ɓoƴsohɗi ɗah, aañaa ɗe ŋ Janguuni, <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />ɓo' mand ɗaa ɗah, wa wooraat ɗa ne a faɗiɗ waasi yurhiɗi. A na bakaaɗe, a atte'iɗ haf ce po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kooɗkiŋ ɓaaɓ ci na askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Ŋ hey ɗa woosohe Artemas wala Tisikos. A ree ɗah, ndengɗuka fu hay fu raak ko ŋ Nikopolis. Ŋ ambiɗ ne jamanooniŋ soosi ŋ nikana ndaam. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Ndengɗuka fu taambkoh Senas ngelohi, a yi na Apolos po ɓa raak in ci ɓa etoh jen ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Ɓooɓiŋ ɓoo joyiɗ nam jang tum baahiɗ ne ɓa ɓaatɗoh ɓo' ŋ etoh ci keeh-keeh ci, ŋ ineem kipes ciŋ ɓa min raakiɗ ɓo' njiriñ.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Ɓooɓi nik na so jen ɓii kañiɗ ɗa. Kañɗiɗ to nawleeciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci. Kooh baahohaat ɗu jen !<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>